<title>ITALY: Olivetti confirms board meeting 1600 GMT.</title>
<headline>Olivetti confirms board meeting 1600 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olivetti confirmed in a statement it had called a board meeting for 1600 GMT on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It gave no other information but newspaper reports have speculated there may be a change at board level with the possibility that chief executive Francesco Caio may be ousted.</p>
</text>
